COMMENT     Route: LAMP1 (AP-3, direct to lysosome)
COMMENT     Asks: Does the direct TGN -> lysosome route beat the
            detour via the cell surface that P0-P4 take?
COMMENT     Blunt-ligate into pJET1.2 in either orientation; recover the IVT
            template by PCR with IVT_F and IVT_R.
